 "<h2>🗺️ День</h2>\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Все игры</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {0}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Простой день</b><small>тропа и двери дня; если выключить — у ребёнка снова все вкладки</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Обязательно каждый день</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Обязательное идёт по тропе по порядку. Остальное — «по желанию», после сундука.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{1}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Двери дня</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdK\">{2}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Сегодня: {3}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{4}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Выключенная тема не приходит в двери. Открыть дверь сегодня:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— выбрать —</option>{5}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Любимая игра</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{6}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">сама: {7}</option>{8}</select>": [
  "<h2>🗺️ Day</h2>\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 All games</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {0}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Simple day</b><small>the path and the doors of the day; if you switch it off, the child gets all the tabs again</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Must-do every day</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">The must-dos go along the path in order. The rest is \"if you like\", after the chest.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{1}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Doors of the day</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdK\">{2}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Today: {3}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{4}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">A topic that is switched off does not come to the doors. Open a door today:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— choose —</option>{5}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Favourite game</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{6}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">automatic: {7}</option>{8}</select>",
  "<h2>🗺️ Dia</h2>\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Todos os jogos</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {0}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Dia simples</b><small>o trilho e as portas do dia; se desligares, a criança volta a ter todos os separadores</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Obrigatório todos os dias</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">As tarefas obrigatórias seguem o trilho por ordem. O resto é «se quiseres», depois do baú.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{1}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Portas do dia</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdK\">{2}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Hoje: {3}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{4}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Um tema desligado não aparece nas portas. Abrir uma porta hoje:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— escolher —</option>{5}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Jogo preferido</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{6}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">automático: {7}</option>{8}</select>",
  "<h2>🗺️ Tag</h2>\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Alle Spiele</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {0}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Einfacher Tag</b><small>der Pfad und die Türen des Tages; wenn du es ausschaltest, hat das Kind wieder alle Reiter</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Jeden Tag Pflicht</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Die Pflichtsachen gehen der Reihe nach über den Pfad. Der Rest ist „wenn du magst“, nach der Truhe.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{1}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Türen des Tages</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdK\">{2}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Heute: {3}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{4}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Ein ausgeschaltetes Thema kommt nicht in die Türen. Heute eine Tür öffnen:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— auswählen —</option>{5}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Lieblingsspiel</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{6}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">automatisch: {7}</option>{8}</select>"
 ],
